  "smallTalk": [
    [
      "Is it pie day in the canteen?",
      "Every day is pie day if you're brave about the fillings."
    ],
    [
      "Who left the forklift parked across the fire door?",
      "Nobody. It parked itself. It does that when it's sulking."
    ],
    [
      "Did you hear the shift whistle?",
      "Hear it? I set my heartbeat by it."
    ],
    [
      "Why are the drawings all blue again?",
      "The drawing office says black ink lacks ambition."
    ],
    [
      "Is that a rivet in your tea?",
      "Iron supplement. The canteen calls it a garnish."
    ],
    [
      "Cold out in the stockyard?",
      "Colder than a quench tank in February."
    ],
    [
      "Anyone seen my safety goggles?",
      "Top of your head. Same place as yesterday."
    ],
    [
      "Fancy overtime on Saturday?",
      "Only if the canteen does the bacon rolls again."
    ]
  ],
  "staff": [
    {
      "name": "Priya Raghunathan",
      "role": "Welder",
      "look": {
        "head": "ponytail",
        "skin": "brown",
        "build": "normal",
        "outfit": "vest",
        "hair": "#1c1414",
        "bow": "#c4561e",
        "shirt": "#3f5470",
        "tie": "#3f5470",
        "outer": "#6b4a2e",
        "accent": "#c9a040",
        "accent2": "#c9a040",
        "pants": "#2e3440",
        "shoes": "#1e1a18",
        "glasses": "#2a2a2a"
      },
      "lines": [
        "Don't look at the arc. Look at me. Actually, don't look at me either.",
        "My bead is smoother than the canteen gravy, and twice as hot.",
        "Sparks are just the steel saying thank you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Declan Furlong",
      "role": "Furnace Keeper",
      "look": {
        "head": "spiky",
        "skin": "rosy",
        "build": "big",
        "outfit": "plain",
        "hair": "#b8562a",
        "hairHighlight": "#d47a42",
        "facialHair": "#a04a24",
        "shirt": "#8a3a22",
        "pants": "#3a3430",
        "shoes": "#201c1a",
        "glasses": "#3a6a5a"
      },
      "lines": [
        "She's at fourteen hundred and happy. Let's keep it that way.",
        "No coat in winter for me. I take the furnace home in my eyebrows.",
        "Nobody opens the furnace without asking me. She's particular."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Tomasz Wilczek",
      "role": "Overhead Crane Driver",
      "look": {
        "head": "headset",
        "skin": "fair",
        "build": "tall",
        "outfit": "polo",
        "hair": "#c9a46a",
        "shirt": "#e07a1f",
        "collar": "#f2c230",
        "accent": "#e8e2d4",
        "pants": "#2f3b52",
        "shoes": "#1e1a18",
        "shortSleeves": true
      },
      "lines": [
        "Lifting! Everybody's feet stay where their feet belong.",
        "Best seat in the works, up here. Worst commute: a very long ladder.",
        "I can land ten tonnes on a sixpence. Please don't put a sixpence down."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Abena Mensah-Clarke",
      "role": "Quality Inspector",
      "look": {
        "head": "bob",
        "skin": "deep",
        "build": "small",
        "outfit": "openCardigan",
        "hair": "#1a1414",
        "shirt": "#2f5d6e",
        "outer": "#e8e4da",
        "collar": "#2f5d6e",
        "pants": "#3a3f4a",
        "shoes": "#2a2220",
        "glasses": "#b04a2a"
      },
      "lines": [
        "Within tolerance. Just. I'll be keeping an eye on that one.",
        "My callipers don't lie, and they can't be bribed with biscuits.",
        "Pass, pass, pass, fail. Don't take it personally, it's a flange."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Hamish Gatenby",
      "role": "Pattern Maker",
      "look": {
        "head": "crossword",
        "skin": "fair",
        "build": "normal",
        "outfit": "cardigan",
        "hair": "#b0a89a",
        "facialHair": "#a09888",
        "shirt": "#d8cbb0",
        "outer": "#7a5a3a",
        "pants": "#4a4038",
        "shoes": "#2a2220",
        "glasses": "#3a2a20"
      },
      "lines": [
        "Every casting starts as a bit of wood and a lot of patience.",
        "Always allow for shrinkage. In metal and in compliments.",
        "Mind the sawdust. It's not mess, it's a byproduct of genius."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Lucia Ferraro",
      "role": "Toolroom Fitter",
      "look": {
        "head": "curly",
        "skin": "olive",
        "build": "normal",
        "outfit": "polo",
        "hair": "#3a2216",
        "hairHighlight": "#5a3a26",
        "shirt": "#2f3b52",
        "collar": "#3f4e6a",
        "accent": "#c9a040",
        "pants": "#2f3b52",
        "shoes": "#1e1a18",
        "belt": true,
        "beltColor": "#6b4a2e"
      },
      "lines": [
        "Sign the tool out, sign it back in. The book remembers everything.",
        "That's a spanner, not a hammer. Yes, there's a difference.",
        "I ground that drill so sharp it makes the other drills nervous."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Ozzie Pemberton",
      "role": "Forklift Driver",
      "look": {
        "head": "hr",
        "skin": "warm",
        "build": "big",
        "outfit": "vest",
        "hair": "#2a1e18",
        "facialHair": "#2a1e18",
        "shirt": "#3f5470",
        "tie": "#3f5470",
        "outer": "#cfd62a",
        "accent": "#c8c8c0",
        "accent2": "#c8c8c0",
        "pants": "#3a3f4a",
        "shoes": "#1e1a18"
      },
      "lines": [
        "Me and the forklift have an understanding. She goes left, I agree.",
        "Beep beep. That's not me, that's her. She's very vocal on corners.",
        "Pallets don't stack themselves. Well, they do, but very badly."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Mei Lindgard",
      "role": "Sand Moulder",
      "look": {
        "head": "prankster",
        "skin": "brown",
        "build": "tall",
        "outfit": "plain",
        "hair": "#2a1a14",
        "shirt": "#5a6b4a",
        "pants": "#4a443e",
        "shoes": "#2a2220",
        "shortSleeves": true,
        "belt": true,
        "beltColor": "#4a3426"
      },
      "lines": [
        "Ram the sand firm, vent it well, and the iron will thank you.",
        "There's an art to sand. There's also a lot of it in my boots.",
        "Pour's at two. Bring a flask and stand behind the yellow line."
      ]
    }
  ],
